  "title": "Issues with email on my smartphone/tablet.",
  "original_html": "<div class=\"entry-content\">\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\" style=\"height:10px\"></div>\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Android Users</strong>:</h4>\n<p>Some native and third-party mail apps do not support Modern Authentication. Please install the Microsoft Outlook app on your Android device.</p>\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\" style=\"height:10px\"></div>\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>iOS users</strong>:</h4>\n<p>The preferred method is to use the Microsoft Outlook app.</p>\n<p>The built-in mail app included with your iPhone or iPad works with Duo 2FA, as long as your iOS version is 11 or better. If your device meets the Duo requirement and you are constantly being prompted to enter your Outlook password, you need to delete and re-add your Outlook account as shown below.</p>\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\" style=\"height:10px\"></div>\n<p><strong>Step 1.</strong> Go to Settings &gt; Passwords &amp; Accounts &gt; [Select your YorkU Outlook account] &gt; Delete Account</p>\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\" style=\"height:10px\"></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-9d6595d7 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1289\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"1024\" sizes=\"(max-width: 576px) 100vw, 576px\" src=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2024/04/IMG_0053-576x1024.png\" srcset=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2024/04/IMG_0053-576x1024.png 576w, https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2024/04/IMG_0053-225x400.png 225w, https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2024/04/IMG_0053.png 750w\" width=\"576\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\"><em>Settings &gt; Passwords &amp; Accounts &gt; [Select your</em> <em>YorkU Outlook account] &gt; Delete Account</em></figcaption></figure>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1290\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1024\" sizes=\"(max-width: 576px) 100vw, 576px\" src=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2024/04/IMG_0054-576x1024.png\" srcset=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2024/04/IMG_0054-576x1024.png 576w, https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2024/04/IMG_0054-225x400.png 225w, https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2024/04/IMG_0054.png 750w\" width=\"576\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\"><em>Confirm Deletion of the Account</em></figcaption></figure>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\" style=\"height:10px\"></div>\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\" style=\"height:10px\"></div>\n<p><strong>Step 2</strong>. Re-add your YorkU Outlook account. Settings &gt; Passwords &amp; Accounts &gt; Add Account &gt; Exchange</p>\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\" style=\"height:10px\"></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-9d6595d7 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1291\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1024\" sizes=\"(max-width: 576px) 100vw, 576px\" src=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2024/04/IMG_0055-576x1024.png\" srcset=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2024/04/IMG_0055-576x1024.png 576w, https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2024/04/IMG_0055-225x400.png 225w, https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2024/04/IMG_0055.png 750w\" width=\"576\"/></figure>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1292\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 576px) 100vw, 576px\" src=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2024/04/IMG_0056-576x1024.png\" srcset=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2024/04/IMG_0056-576x1024.png 576w, https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2024/04/IMG_0056-225x400.png 225w, https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2024/04/IMG_0056.png 750w\" width=\"576\"/></figure>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\" style=\"height:10px\"></div>\n<p><strong>Step 3.</strong> Enter your full YorkU email address e.g <strong>duomfa@yorku.ca</strong>. For the Description, you can type in <strong>YorkU</strong>. Click <strong>Next</strong>.</p>\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\" style=\"height:10px\"></div>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large is-resized\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-2463\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 576px) 100vw, 576px\" src=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2025/11/yu-exchan-576x1024.png\" srcset=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2025/11/yu-exchan-576x1024.png 576w, https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2025/11/yu-exchan-225x400.png 225w, https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2025/11/yu-exchan.png 750w\" style=\"width:513px;height:913px\" width=\"576\"/></figure>\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\" style=\"height:10px\"></div>\n<p><strong>Step 4. </strong>Click <strong>Sign In</strong> and enter your Passport York password. Then click <strong>Sign In </strong>again.</p>\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\" style=\"height:10px\"></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-9d6595d7 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1293\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 576px) 100vw, 576px\" src=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2024/04/IMG_0058-576x1024.png\" srcset=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2024/04/IMG_0058-576x1024.png 576w, https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2024/04/IMG_0058-225x400.png 225w, https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2024/04/IMG_0058.png 750w\" width=\"576\"/></figure>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1294\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 576px) 100vw, 576px\" src=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2024/04/IMG_0060-576x1024.png\" srcset=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2024/04/IMG_0060-576x1024.png 576w, https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2024/04/IMG_0060-225x400.png 225w, https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2024/04/IMG_0060.png 750w\" width=\"576\"/></figure>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\" style=\"height:10px\"></div>\n<p><strong>Step 5.</strong> Assuming that your iPhone/iPad has a passcode, you can click <strong>Save Password </strong>and validate the Duo request on your phone.</p>\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\" style=\"height:10px\"></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-9d6595d7 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1295\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 576px) 100vw, 576px\" src=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2024/04/IMG_0061-1-576x1024.png\" srcset=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2024/04/IMG_0061-1-576x1024.png 576w, https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2024/04/IMG_0061-1-225x400.png 225w, https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2024/04/IMG_0061-1.png 750w\" width=\"576\"/></figure>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1296\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 576px) 100vw, 576px\" src=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2024/04/IMG_0063-1-576x1024.png\" srcset=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2024/04/IMG_0063-1-576x1024.png 576w, https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2024/04/IMG_0063-1-225x400.png 225w, https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2024/04/IMG_0063-1.png 750w\" width=\"576\"/></figure>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\" style=\"height:10px\"></div>\n<p><strong>Step 6.</strong> Microsoft may prompt you for a permission request. Click <strong>Accept </strong>and select your desired Exchange attributes.</p>\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\" style=\"height:10px\"></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-9d6595d7 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1297\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 576px) 100vw, 576px\" src=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2024/04/IMG_0052-576x1024.png\" srcset=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2024/04/IMG_0052-576x1024.png 576w, https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2024/04/IMG_0052-225x400.png 225w, https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2024/04/IMG_0052.png 750w\" width=\"576\"/></figure>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1298\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 576px) 100vw, 576px\" src=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2024/04/IMG_0064-576x1024.png\" srcset=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2024/04/IMG_0064-576x1024.png 576w, https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2024/04/IMG_0064-225x400.png 225w, https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2024/04/IMG_0064.png 750w\" width=\"576\"/></figure>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\" style=\"height:10px\"></div>\n<p>Congratulations, Your YorkU Outlook account has been successfully re-added.</p>\n<p><strong>Step 7 </strong>(Optional). If you have more than one email account configured on your iPhone or iPad and wish to set the YorkU Outlook account as the default, go to <strong>Settings </strong>&gt; <strong>Mail </strong>&gt; <strong>Default Account</strong> and choose \"<em>YorkU\"</em>.</p>\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\" style=\"height:10px\"></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-9d6595d7 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1299\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 576px) 100vw, 576px\" src=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2024/04/IMG_0068a-576x1024.png\" srcset=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2024/04/IMG_0068a-576x1024.png 576w, https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2024/04/IMG_0068a-225x400.png 225w, https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2024/04/IMG_0068a.png 750w\" width=\"576\"/></figure>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1300\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 576px) 100vw, 576px\" src=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2024/04/IMG_0069-576x1024.png\" srcset=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2024/04/IMG_0069-576x1024.png 576w, https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2024/04/IMG_0069-225x400.png 225w, https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2024/04/IMG_0069.png 750w\" width=\"576\"/></figure>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\" style=\"height:10px\"></div>\n<p>Back to <a href=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/duo-two-factor-authentication/#tab-stronggeneralissuesandtroubleshootingstrong\">General Issues and Troubleshooting page</a></p>\n<div class=\"entry-links\"></div>\n</div>",
  "html": "\n<h4><strong>Android Users</strong>:</h4>\n<p>Some native and third-party mail apps do not support Modern Authentication. Please install the Microsoft Outlook app on your Android device.</p>\n<h4><strong>iOS users</strong>:</h4>\n<p>The preferred method is to use the Microsoft Outlook app.</p>\n<p>The built-in mail app included with your iPhone or iPad works with Duo 2FA, as long as your iOS version is 11 or better. If your device meets the Duo requirement and you are constantly being prompted to enter your Outlook password, you need to delete and re-add your Outlook account as shown below.</p>\n<p><strong>Step 1.</strong> Go to Settings &gt; Passwords &amp; Accounts &gt; [Select your YorkU Outlook account] &gt; Delete Account</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2024/04/IMG_0053-576x1024.png\"/><figcaption><em>Settings &gt; Passwords &amp; Accounts &gt; [Select your</em> <em>YorkU Outlook account] &gt; Delete Account</em></figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2024/04/IMG_0054-576x1024.png\"/><figcaption><em>Confirm Deletion of the Account</em></figcaption></figure>\n<p><strong>Step 2</strong>. Re-add your YorkU Outlook account. Settings &gt; Passwords &amp; Accounts &gt; Add Account &gt; Exchange</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2024/04/IMG_0055-576x1024.png\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2024/04/IMG_0056-576x1024.png\"/></figure>\n<p><strong>Step 3.</strong> Enter your full YorkU email address e.g <strong>duomfa@yorku.ca</strong>. For the Description, you can type in <strong>YorkU</strong>. Click <strong>Next</strong>.</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2025/11/yu-exchan-576x1024.png\"/></figure>\n<p><strong>Step 4. </strong>Click <strong>Sign In</strong> and enter your Passport York password. Then click <strong>Sign In </strong>again.</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2024/04/IMG_0058-576x1024.png\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2024/04/IMG_0060-576x1024.png\"/></figure>\n<p><strong>Step 5.</strong> Assuming that your iPhone/iPad has a passcode, you can click <strong>Save Password </strong>and validate the Duo request on your phone.</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2024/04/IMG_0061-1-576x1024.png\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2024/04/IMG_0063-1-576x1024.png\"/></figure>\n<p><strong>Step 6.</strong> Microsoft may prompt you for a permission request. Click <strong>Accept </strong>and select your desired Exchange attributes.</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2024/04/IMG_0052-576x1024.png\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2024/04/IMG_0064-576x1024.png\"/></figure>\n<p>Congratulations, Your YorkU Outlook account has been successfully re-added.</p>\n<p><strong>Step 7 </strong>(Optional). If you have more than one email account configured on your iPhone or iPad and wish to set the YorkU Outlook account as the default, go to <strong>Settings </strong>&gt; <strong>Mail </strong>&gt; <strong>Default Account</strong> and choose \"<em>YorkU\"</em>.</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2024/04/IMG_0068a-576x1024.png\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2024/04/IMG_0069-576x1024.png\"/></figure>\n<p>Back to <a href=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/duo-two-factor-authentication/#tab-stronggeneralissuesandtroubleshootingstrong\">General Issues and Troubleshooting page</a></p>\n",
  "text": "Android Users : Some native and third-party mail apps do not support Modern Authentication. Please install the Microsoft Outlook app on your Android device. iOS users : The preferred method is to use the Microsoft Outlook app. The built-in mail app included with your iPhone or iPad works with Duo 2FA, as long as your iOS version is 11 or better. If your device meets the Duo requirement and you are constantly being prompted to enter your Outlook password, you need to delete and re-add your Outlook account as shown below. Step 1. Go to Settings > Passwords & Accounts > [Select your YorkU Outlook account] > Delete Account Settings > Passwords & Accounts > [Select your YorkU Outlook account] > Delete Account Confirm Deletion of the Account Step 2 . Re-add your YorkU Outlook account. Settings > Passwords & Accounts > Add Account > Exchange Step 3. Enter your full YorkU email address e.g duomfa@yorku.ca . For the Description, you can type in YorkU . Click Next . Step 4. Click Sign In and enter your Passport York password. Then click Sign In again. Step 5. Assuming that your iPhone/iPad has a passcode, you can click Save Password and validate the Duo request on your phone. Step 6. Microsoft may prompt you for a permission request. Click Accept and select your desired Exchange attributes. Congratulations, Your YorkU Outlook account has been successfully re-added. Step 7 (Optional). If you have more than one email account configured on your iPhone or iPad and wish to set the YorkU Outlook account as the default, go to Settings > Mail > Default Account and choose \" YorkU\" . Back to General Issues and Troubleshooting page",
